+
+### Positive claims, run separately
+
+Every claim was selected and run independently against the fresh proof
+definition. Each command exited 0 and printed `#Top`:
+
+| Claim | Evidence |
+|---|---|
+| `SPEC.empty-input` | [10-kprove-empty-input.log](evidence/10-kprove-empty-input.log) |
+| `SPEC.all-single-grades` | [10-kprove-all-single-grades.log](evidence/10-kprove-all-single-grades.log) |
+| `SPEC.loop-step-new-variable` | [10-kprove-loop-step-new-variable.log](evidence/10-kprove-loop-step-new-variable.log) |
